<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px; text-align: center; mso-line-height-alt: 33px;"><span style="font-size:22px;color:#000101;"><span style="">You have successfully created an account, you may now log in your account and create courses. </span><br/></span></p>
</div>
</div>
